#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable All Thresholds"
msgstr "Deaktiveer alle drempels"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Alerting on all Thresholds.  This can be used when it is necessary to perform maintenance on your network."
msgstr "Deur hierdie blokkie te merk, word alarmering op alle Drempels gedeaktiveer.  Dit kan gebruik word wanneer dit nodig is om instandhouding op jou netwerk uit te voer."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Auto Create Thresholds"
msgstr "Skep drempels outomaties"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If selected, when running either automation, or when creating/saving a Device, all Thresholds associated with the Device Template will be created."
msgstr "Indien gekies, wanneer outomatisering uitgevoer word of wanneer 'n Toestel geskep/gestoor word, sal alle Drempels wat met die Toestelsjabloon geassosieer word, geskep word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Beskou onbekende data as nul"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When checking Thresholds, if a Data Source returns Unknown Data ('U'), consider the value as zero for the Threshold check. You can also enable log this issue."
msgstr "Wanneer Drempels nagegaan word en 'n Databron onbekende data ('U') terugstuur, beskou die waarde as nul vir die Drempel-kontrole. Jy kan ook die aantekening van hierdie probleem aktiveer."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Management Status"
msgstr "Verstek-bestuurstatus"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Threshold management filter status."
msgstr "Verstek Drempel-bestuursfilterstatus."

