#: thold_templates.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Geaktiveer"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Empty ifHighSpeed Default"
msgstr "Verstek vir leë ifHighSpeed"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When calculating Expression Thresholds, if the ifHighSpeed and ifSpeed come back as zero, use the following ifHighSpeed setting instead.  Default ifHighSpeed will be 10000 for 10GE interfaces."
msgstr "Wanneer uitdrukkingsdrempels bereken word en die ifHighSpeed en ifSpeed as nul terugkom, gebruik eerder die volgende ifHighSpeed-instelling.  Verstek ifHighSpeed sal 10000 wees vir 10GE-koppelvlakke."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Kennisgewingvoorkeure"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Legacy Notifications"
msgstr "Deaktiveer verouderde kennisgewings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Legacy Alerting on all Thresholds.  Legacy Alerting is defined as any Specific Email Alerts not associated with a Notification List."
msgstr "Deur hierdie blokkie te merk, word Verouderde Alarmering op alle Drempels gedeaktiveer.  Verouderde Alarmering word gedefinieer as enige Spesifieke E-posalarms wat nie aan 'n Kennisgewinglys gekoppel is nie."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Notification Templated"
msgstr "Drempelkennisgewing gesjabloneer"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating at Threshold Template, its Notification Settings will, by default be owned by the Threshold Template."
msgstr "Indien gemerk, sal die Kennisgewinginstellings van 'n Drempelsjabloon by verstek deur die Drempelsjabloon besit word wanneer dit geskep word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Aktiveer opdraguitvoering"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Threshold breach and restoral events."
msgstr "Deur hierdie blokkie te merk, word die vermoë geaktiveer om opdragte uit te voer tydens Drempel-oortredings- en herstelgebeurtenisse."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Per Thold Notification"
msgstr "Aktiveer kennisgewing per Thold"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to maintain custom Email bodies for Thresholds."
msgstr "Deur hierdie blokkie te merk, word die vermoë geaktiveer om pasgemaakte E-posliggame vir Drempels in stand te hou."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgstr "Aktiveer kennisgewingwagry"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will switch Thold from performing inline Notification to using either the Notification Daemon, or notifications performed out of band by the Notification poller."
msgstr "Deur hierdie blokkie te merk, skakel Thold oor van inlyn-kennisgewing na die gebruik van óf die Kennisgewing-daemon, óf kennisgewings wat buiteband deur die Kennisgewing-poller uitgevoer word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Sending Alert Emails to Warning Notification Lists"
msgstr "Aktiveer die stuur van waarskuwings-e-posse na Waarskuwingskennisgewinglyste"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Check this box if you wish Warning Notification List recipients to receive Alert Emails in addition to the Alert Notification list receivers.  This case is applicable when Warning Notifications goes to Administrators and Alert Notifications go to Management."
msgstr "Merk hierdie blokkie as jy wil hê dat ontvangers van die Waarskuwingskennisgewinglys benewens die ontvangers van die Alarmkennisgewinglys ook Alarm-e-posse moet ontvang.  Hierdie geval is van toepassing wanneer Waarskuwingskennisgewings na Administrateurs gaan en Alarmkennisgewings na Bestuur gaan."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Drempeldaemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Aktiveer Drempel-daemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the use of a dedicated Threshold daemon. This can be used to increase system performance and/or to distribute Threshold monitoring to a separate server."
msgstr "Deur hierdie blokkie te merk, word die gebruik van 'n toegewyde Drempel-daemon geaktiveer. Dit kan gebruik word om stelselwerkverrigting te verhoog en/of om Drempelmonitering na 'n afsonderlike bediener te versprei."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Force Threshold Daemon Debug"
msgstr "Dwing Drempel-daemon-ontfouting af"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable Threshold Daemon debug when operating from SystemD or through the command line.  This change is dynamic and will take effect as soon as the next Threshold loop commences."
msgstr "Deur hierdie blokkie te merk, word Drempel-daemon-ontfouting geaktiveer wanneer dit vanaf SystemD of via die opdragreël werk.  Hierdie verandering is dinamies en sal in werking tree sodra die volgende Drempel-lus begin."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Down Notification Frequency"
msgstr "Kennisgewingsfrekwensie vir daemon af"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If the Thold Daemon is found to be down, send out an Email notification at this frequency."
msgstr "Indien die Thold-diensproses (daemon) nie loop nie, stuur 'n E-poskennisgewing teen hierdie frekwensie uit."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Hour"
msgstr "Elke %d uur"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Threads"
msgstr "Daemon-drade"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The number of daemon threads to be handled by the Threshold Daemon."
msgstr "Die aantal daemon-drade wat deur die Drempel-daemon hanteer moet word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 proses"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d prosesse"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Loghouding"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Breaches"
msgstr "Teken Drempeloortredings aan"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold failures to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Aktiveer logboekregistrasie van alle Drempel-mislukkings na die Cacti-logboek."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show Data Source in Log"
msgstr "Wys Databron in logboek"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show the Data Source name in the Log if not present."
msgstr "Wys die Databron-naam in die logboek indien dit nie teenwoordig is nie."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Changes"
msgstr "Teken Drempelveranderings aan"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold changes to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Aktiveer logboekregistrasie van alle Drempel-veranderings na die Cacti-logboek."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Ontfoutingslogboek"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of debug messages with Threshold"
msgstr "Aktiveer logboekregistrasie van ontfoutingsboodskappe met Drempel"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Log Retention"
msgstr "Alarmlogboek-retensie"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep Threshold Logs for this number of days."
msgstr "Behou drempellogboeke vir hierdie aantal dae."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log action Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Teken aksie Beskou Onbekende Data as Nul aan"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When 'Consider Unknown Data as Zero' is enabled, log when it occurs"
msgstr "Wanneer 'Beskou onbekende data as nul' geaktiveer is, teken aan wanneer dit voorkom"

#: includes/settings.php thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Syslog Settings"
msgstr "Syslog-instellings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog geaktiveer"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating a new Threshold, by default new Threshold events will be sent to your local syslog.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Indien gemerk, sal nuwe Drempel-gebeurtenisse by verstek na u plaaslike syslog gestuur word wanneer 'n nuwe Drempel geskep word.  Hierdie instelling is 'n voorafinstelling.  Drempel-instellings bepaal die werklike syslog-beheer."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Priority/Level"
msgstr "Verstek-prioriteit/-vlak"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Priority/Level that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Dit is die verstek-Prioriteit/Vlak wat Thold sal gebruik om syslog-boodskappe te stuur. Hierdie instelling is 'n voorafinstelling. Drempel-instellings bepaal die werklike syslog-beheer."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Facility"
msgstr "Verstek-fasiliteit"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Facility that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Dit is die verstek-Fasiliteit wat Thold sal gebruik om syslog-boodskappe te stuur. Hierdie instelling is 'n voorafinstelling. Drempel-instellings bepaal die werklike syslog-beheer."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Presets"
msgstr "Alarm-voorafinstellings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Weekend exemptions"
msgstr "Naweekvrystellings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Thold will not run on weekends."
msgstr "Indien dit gemerk is, sal Thold nie oor naweke loop nie."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Trigger Count"
msgstr "Verstek-snellertelling"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Verstek aantal opeenvolgende kere wat die Databron die Drempel moet oorskry voordat 'n Waarskuwing gegee word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Re-Alerting"
msgstr "Heralarmering"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat Alert after specified number of poller cycles."
msgstr "Herhaal waarskuwing na gespesifiseerde aantal poller-siklusse."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Presets"
msgstr "Basislynvoorinstellings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Time Range Default"
msgstr "Standaard basislyntydbestek"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default value used in creating Thresholds or templates."
msgstr "Dit is die verstekwaarde wat gebruik word by die skep van Drempels of sjablone."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Trigger Count"
msgstr "Basislyn-snellertelling"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the calculated Baseline Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Verstek aantal opeenvolgende kere wat die Databron die berekende Basislyn-drempel moet oorskry voordat 'n Waarskuwing gegee word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Deviation Percentage"
msgstr "Basislynafwikingspersentasie"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notification Options"
msgstr "SNMP-kennisgewingopsies"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notifications"
msgstr "SNMP-kennisgewings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold status messages (informs/traps) will be sent to SNMP notification receivers. This includes Alerts, Warnings and Restoration traps per default. Note: This feature requires the Cacti SNMPAgent plugin."
msgstr "Drempelstatusboodskappe (informs/traps) sal aan SNMP-kennisgewingontvangers gestuur word. Dit sluit by verstek alarms, waarskuwings en herstel-traps in. Let wel: Hierdie kenmerk vereis die Cacti SNMPAgent-inprop."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Warning Notifications"
msgstr "Deaktiveer waarskuwingskennisgewings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when a warning Threshold has been breached."
msgstr "Indien dit gemerk is, sal Drempel nie 'n kennisgewing stuur wanneer 'n waarskuwingsdrempel oorskry is nie."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Restoration Notifications"
msgstr "Deaktiveer herstelkennisgewings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when the Threshold has returned to normal status."
msgstr "Indien dit gemerk is, sal Drempel nie 'n kennisgewing stuur wanneer die Drempel na normale status teruggekeer het nie."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "E-posopsies"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Emails with Urgent Priority"
msgstr "Stuur E-posse met Dringende Prioriteit"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allows you to set Emails with urgent priority"
msgstr "Laat u toe om E-posse met dringende prioriteit te stel"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Alerts as Text"
msgstr "Stuur Alarms as Teks"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Alerts to be sent as plain text Emails with no graph.  The default is HTML Emails with the graph embedded in the Email."
msgstr "Indien gemerk, sal alle alarms as skoon teks-e-posse sonder 'n grafiek gestuur word.  Die verstekwaarde is HTML-e-posse met die grafiek in die e-pos ingebed."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "Stuur E-pos afsonderlik vir elke adres"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Indien gemerk, sal alle e-posse afsonderlik vir elke adres gestuur word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Van-e-posadres"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Dit is die E-posadres waarvandaan die Drempel sal lyk te kom."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Van-naam"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Dit is die werklike naam waarvandaan die Drempel sal lyk te kom."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Options"
msgstr "Toestelkennisgewing-opsies"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notifications"
msgstr "Aktiveer kennisgewings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Dead/Recovering host notification"
msgstr "Aktiveer kennisgewing vir onbereikbare/herstellende gasheer"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification"
msgstr "Enkele E-poskennisgewing"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Supported for Notification Lists and the Notification Queue only.  If there are Down Device Notifications in a single processing cycle.  Send only one Email to Notification List repipients for all Devices."
msgstr "Slegs ondersteun vir kennisgewinglyste en die kennisgewingtou. Indien daar kennisgewings oor af-toestelle in 'n enkele verwerkingsiklus is, stuur slegs een e-pos aan kennisgewinglys-ontvangers vir alle toestelle."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification Subject"
msgstr "Onderwerp van enkele E-poskennisgewing"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email Subject to be used for all Single Email Notification Emails for both Up and Down Devices."
msgstr "Dit is die E-posonderwerp wat gebruik moet word vir alle Enkel-E-poskennisgewing-e-posse vir beide Op en Af Toestelle."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Delay Options"
msgstr "Opsies vir toestelkennisgewing-vertraging"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Delay"
msgstr "Kennisgewingvertraging"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If a large influx of Down Device Notifications come in, Cacti can pause sending out those Notifications for a certain period of time to see if the issue is transient before sending them out.  Select the threshold Down Device Notifications before the Pause is Triggered."
msgstr "As 'n groot toestroming van af-Toestel-kennisgewings inkom, kan Cacti die uitstuur van daardie kennisgewings vir 'n sekere tydperk onderbreek om te sien of die probleem verbygaande is voordat dit uitgestuur word.  Kies die drempel van af-Toestel-kennisgewings voordat die onderbreking geaktiveer word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If you choose to delay Notifications for a large Down Devices Notification inrush, how long are you willing to wait before allowing the notifications to be processed?"
msgstr "Indien u kies om Kennisgewings te vertraag vir 'n groot instroming van Af-toestelle-kennisgewings, hoe lank is u bereid om te wag voordat die kennisgewings verwerk mag word?"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Email Options"
msgstr "Opsies vir toestelkennisgewing-e-pos"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Global Notification Email"
msgstr "Globale kennisgewing-e-pos"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email Address that the Dead Device Notifications will be sent to if the Global Notification List is selected."
msgstr "Dit is die E-posadres waarheen Kennisgewings van Dooie Toestelle gestuur sal word as die Globale Kennisgewinglys gekies is."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Down Subject"
msgstr "Af-onderwerp"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email subject that will be used for Down Device Messages. There are several common replacement tags that may be used in include:<br>&#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060SITE&#062 &#060LOCATION&#062 &#060DOWN/UP&#062 &#060DOWNTIME&#062 (last state up duration in case down message) &#060NOTES&#062"
msgstr "Dit is die E-posonderwerp wat gebruik sal word vir Af Toestel-boodskappe. Daar is verskeie algemene vervangingsetikette wat ingesluit kan word:<br>&#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060SITE&#062 &#060LOCATION&#062 &#060DOWN/UP&#062 &#060DOWNTIME&#062 (laaste op-toestand-duur in die geval van 'n af-boodskap) &#060NOTES&#062"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Error: <DESCRIPTION> (<HOSTNAME>) is DOWN"
msgstr "Toestelfout: <DESCRIPTION> (<HOSTNAME>) is AF"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Down Message"
msgstr "Af-boodskap"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the message that will be displayed as the message body of all UP / Down Device Messages (1024 Char MAX).  HTML is allowed, but will be removed for text only Emails.  There are several common replacement tags that may be used in include:<br>&#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060HOST_ID&#062 &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060SITE&#062 &#060LOCATION&#062 &#060UPTIME&#062 &#060UPTIMETEXT&#062 &#060DOWNTIME&#062 (last state up duration in case down message) &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062 &#060MESSAGE&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060DOWN/UP&#062 &#060SNMP_HOSTNAME&#062 &#060SNMP_LOCATION&#062 &#060SNMP_CONTACT&#062 &#060SNMP_SYSTEM&#062 &#060LAST_FAIL&#062 &#060AVAILABILITY&#062 &#060TOT_POLL&#062 &#060FAIL_POLL&#062 &#060CUR_TIME&#062 &#060AVG_TIME&#062 &#060NOTES&#062"
