#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "High Trigger Command"
msgstr "Hoë Snellerbevel"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a High Threshold is breached, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data Input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Indien gestel, en as 'n Hoë Drempel oorskry word, sal hierdie opdrag uitgevoer word.  Voer asseblief 'n geldige opdrag in.  Daarbenewens is daar verskeie vervangingsmerkers beskikbaar wat gebruik kan word om inligting vanaf die Drempel na die skrip oor te dra.  U kan dit as argumente op die opdragreël doen, of verkieslik in die omgewing van die skrip.  Alle vervangingswaardes sal in die omgewing van die skrip verskyn met die voorvoegsel THOLD_.  Byvoorbeeld, CURRENTVALUE sal THOLD_CURRENTVALUE word, ensovoorts.  Die veranderlikes sluit in: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Ten slotte kan Gasheer-, Datanavraag- en Data-invoervervanging gedoen word.  Byvoorbeeld, as u pasgemaakte data-invoer genaamd pending het, gebruik |pending| om die vervanging uit te voer.  Vir Datanavraag- en Gasheervervanging, gebruik onderskeidelik die Cacti-konvensies |query_xxxx| en |host_xxxx|."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Low Trigger Command"
msgstr "Lae Sneller-opdrag"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a Low Threshold is breached, this command will be run. Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Indien gestel, en as 'n Lae Drempel oorskry word, sal hierdie opdrag uitgevoer word.  Voer asseblief 'n geldige opdrag in.  Daarbenewens is daar verskeie vervangingsmerkers beskikbaar wat gebruik kan word om inligting vanaf die Drempel na die skrip oor te dra.  U kan dit as argumente op die opdragreël doen, of verkieslik in die omgewing van die skrip.  Alle vervangingswaardes sal in die omgewing van die skrip verskyn met die voorvoegsel THOLD_.  Byvoorbeeld, CURRENTVALUE sal THOLD_CURRENTVALUE word, ensovoorts.  Die veranderlikes sluit in: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Ten slotte kan Gasheer-, Datanavraag- en Data-invoervervanging gedoen word.  Byvoorbeeld, as u pasgemaakte data-invoer genaamd pending het, gebruik |pending| om die vervanging uit te voer.  Vir Datanavraag- en Gasheervervanging, gebruik onderskeidelik die Cacti-konvensies |query_xxxx| en |host_xxxx|."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Norm Trigger Command"
msgstr "Norm-snelleropdrag"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, when a thold falls back to a normal value, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Indien gestel, wanneer 'n drempel terugval na 'n normale waarde, sal hierdie opdrag uitgevoer word.  Voer asseblief 'n geldige opdrag in.  Daarbenewens is daar verskeie vervangingsmerkers beskikbaar wat gebruik kan word om inligting vanaf die Drempel na die skrip oor te dra.  U kan dit as argumente op die opdragreël doen, of verkieslik in die omgewing van die skrip.  Alle vervangingswaardes sal in die omgewing van die skrip verskyn met die voorvoegsel THOLD_.  Byvoorbeeld, CURRENTVALUE sal THOLD_CURRENTVALUE word, ensovoorts.  Die veranderlikes sluit in: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Ten slotte kan Gasheer-, Datanavraag- en Data-invoervervanging gedoen word.  Byvoorbeeld, as u pasgemaakte data-invoer genaamd pending het, gebruik |pending| om die vervanging uit te voer.  Vir Datanavraag- en Gasheervervanging, gebruik onderskeidelik die Cacti-konvensies |query_xxxx| en |host_xxxx|."

