#: thold_templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "An RPN Expression is an RRDtool Compatible RPN Expression.  Syntax includes all functions below in addition to both Device and Data Query replacement expressions such as <span style=\"color:blue;\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>.  To use a Data Source in the RPN Expression, you must use the syntax: <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:dsname|</span>.  For example, <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> will get the current value of the traffic_in Data Source for the RRDfile(s) associated with the Graph. Any Data Source for a Graph can be included.<br>Math Operators: <span style=\"color:blue;\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Functions: <span style=\"color:blue;\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Flow Operators: <span style=\"color:blue;\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Comparison Functions: <span style=\"color:blue;\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"
msgstr "'n RPN-uitdrukking is 'n RRDtool-versoenbare RPN-uitdrukking.  Sintaksis sluit al die funksies hieronder in, benewens sowel Toestel- as Datanavraag-vervangingsuitdrukkings soos <span style=\"color:blue;\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>.  Om 'n Databron in die RPN-uitdrukking te gebruik, moet u die sintaksis gebruik: <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:dsname|</span>.  Byvoorbeeld, <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> sal die huidige waarde van die traffic_in-databron kry vir die RRD-lêer(s) wat aan die Grafiek gekoppel is. Enige Databron vir 'n Grafiek kan ingesluit word.<br>Wiskunde-operatore: <span style=\"color:blue;\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Funksies: <span style=\"color:blue;\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Vloei-operatore: <span style=\"color:blue;\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Vergelykingsfunksies: <span style=\"color:blue;\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"

#: thold_templates.php
